## The screen

| Route | Path | |
|---|---|---|
| `monitoring_index` | `GET /monitoring/` | the incidents, filtered by `?status=` — `active` (the default), a status, `all` —, paged by `?page=`; the heartbeats under them |
| `monitoring_incident_show` | `GET /monitoring/incidents/{id}` | one incident and its decisions |
| `api_monitoring_incident_decide` | `POST /_api/monitoring/incident/{id}/{acknowledge\|resolve\|ignore}` | body `{"note": "…"}`, the note optional; answers `{status}` |

A decision is taken by the signed-in user, kept as who changed the status. The one already standing is not offered again.

The texts of the statuses, severities and source types are in `assets/common/monitoring.trans.yml`; a source type the application names itself shows as it is, unless the application translates it under the same domain.
